dialogue.htmlContent:
		#IF(flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_rare') != 4 || flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_epic') != 4 || flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_legendary') != 1)
			<p>
				You give the crystal to her, and almost instantly, it's gone from your hand. [ringmaker.speech(Ah, yeeeeees.... a crystal! Shiny, shiny crystal... ehehehehehe...~)] The old ringmaker creepily laughs, rubbing her cheek against it... 
				#IF(flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_rare') != 4 && pc.hasWeaponType(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_rare, true))
					[ringmaker.speech(Mm, mm... Yes, this is good enough...)] 
				#ELSEIF(flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_epic') != 4 && pc.hasWeaponType(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_epic, true))
					[ringmaker.speech(And it's a epic one! Yes, good... very good...)] 
				#ELSE
					[ringmaker.speech(And you're really giving me a <i>legendary</i> one too! Oooooooh, you know how to make a woman happy, dear...~)] 
				#ENDIF
			</p>
			<p>
				The old woman bounds towards the back of the counter in a speed unfitting for her age, slipping into the door behind her. You're left all alone in the shop, feeling quite baffled at the spectacle. 
			</p>
			<p>
				But that doesn't compare to the sounds coming from beyond the door: noises like crunching, moaning, grinding, and more... The entire store seems to vibrate at whatever the ringmaker is doing to the poor demonstone. 
			</p>
			<p>
				It isn't until 10 minutes later that the old woman emerges from the door, her cloak disheveled and covered in crystal dust and soot, with arcane energy sparking around her. [ringmaker.speech(It's done...)] she says, her voice sounds quite shaky but satisfied, as she drops a brilliantly cut gemstone ring into your hand. [ringmaker.speech(And here's your payment... try it out in combat next time...)]
			</p>

			#IF(flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_rare') != 4 && pc.hasWeaponType(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_rare, true))
				[##
					var weaponArray = pc.getAllWeaponsInInventory().keySet().toArray();
					var mainArray = pc.getMainWeaponArray();
					var offArray = pc.getOffhandWeaponArray();
					var temp = flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_rare');
					for (var i = 0; i < weaponArray.length; i++) {
						var weapon = weaponArray[i];
						if(weapon.getWeaponType().equals(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_rare)) {
							var colour = weapon.getDamageType().getColour();
							if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_glow, true)) {
								game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_glow, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
							}
							else if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_clean, true)) {
								game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_clean, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
							}
							else if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_heal, true)) {
								game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_heal, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
							}
							else {
								game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_defend, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
							};
							flags.setSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_rare', flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_rare') + 1);
							pc.removeWeapon(weapon);
							break;
						};
					};
				
					if(temp == flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_rare')) {
						for (var i = 0; i < mainArray.length; i++) {
							var weapon = mainArray[i];
							if(weapon != null && weapon.getWeaponType().equals(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_rare)) {
								var colour = weapon.getDamageType().getColour();
								if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_glow, true)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_glow, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								}
								else if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_clean, true)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_clean, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								}
								else if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_heal, true)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_heal, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								}
								else {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_defend, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								};
								flags.setSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_rare', flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_rare') + 1);
								pc.unequipMainWeaponIntoVoid(i, false);
								break;
							};
						};
					};

					if(temp == flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_rare')) {
						for (var i = 0; i < offArray.length; i++) {
							var weapon = offArray[i];
							if(weapon != null && weapon.getWeaponType().equals(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_rare)) {
								var colour = weapon.getDamageType().getColour();
								if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_glow, true)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_glow, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								}
								else if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_clean, true)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_clean, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								}
								else if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_heal, true)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_heal, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								}
								else {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_defend, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								};
								flags.setSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_rare', flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_rare') + 1);
								pc.unequipOffhandWeaponIntoVoid(i, false);
								break;
							};
						};
					};
				]
			#ELSEIF(flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_epic') != 4 && pc.hasWeaponType(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_epic, true))
				[##
					var weaponArray = pc.getAllWeaponsInInventory().keySet().toArray();
					var mainArray = pc.getMainWeaponArray();
					var offArray = pc.getOffhandWeaponArray();
					var temp = flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_epic');
					for (var i = 0; i < weaponArray.length; i++) {
						var weapon = weaponArray[i];
						if(weapon.getWeaponType().equals(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_epic)) {
							var colour = weapon.getDamageType().getColour();
							if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_accelerate, true)) {
								game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_accelerate, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
							}
							else if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_bind, true)) {
								game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_bind, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
							}
							else if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_excite, true)) {
								game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_excite, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
							}
							else {
								game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_finisher, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
							};
							flags.setSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_epic', flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_epic') + 1);
							pc.removeWeapon(weapon);
							break;
						};
					};
				
					if(temp == flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_epic')) {
						for (var i = 0; i < mainArray.length; i++) {
							var weapon = mainArray[i];
							if(weapon != null && weapon.getWeaponType().equals(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_epic)) {
								var colour = weapon.getDamageType().getColour();
								if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_accelerate, true)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_accelerate, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								}
								else if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_bind, true)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_bind, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								}
								else if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_excite, true)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_excite, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								}
								else {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_finisher, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								};
								flags.setSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_epic', flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_epic') + 1);
								pc.unequipMainWeaponIntoVoid(i, false);
								break;
							};
						};
					};

					if(temp == flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_epic')) {
						for (var i = 0; i < offArray.length; i++) {
							var weapon = offArray[i];
							if(weapon != null && weapon.getWeaponType().equals(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_epic)) {
								var colour = weapon.getDamageType().getColour();
								if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_accelerate, true)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_accelerate, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								}
								else if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_bind, true)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_bind, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								}
								else if(!pc.hasClothingType(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_excite, true)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_excite, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								}
								else {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addClothing(itemGen.generateClothing(CLOTHING_xys_rings_ring_finisher, COLOUR_CLOTHING_STEEL, colour, null, false), false));
								};
								flags.setSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_epic', flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_epic') + 1);
								pc.unequipOffhandWeaponIntoVoid(i, false);
								break;
							};
						};
					};
				]
			#ELSEIF(flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_legendary') != 1 && pc.hasWeaponType(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_legendary, true))
				[##
					var weaponArray = pc.getAllWeaponsInInventory().keySet().toArray();
					var mainArray = pc.getMainWeaponArray();
					var offArray = pc.getOffhandWeaponArray();
					var temp = flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_legendary');
					for (var i = 0; i < weaponArray.length; i++) {
						var weapon = weaponArray[i];
						if(weapon.getWeaponType().equals(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_legendary)) {
							if(weapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_FIRE)) {
								game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem(ITEM_xys_rings_ring_special_fire), false));
							}
							else if(weapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_ICE)) {
								game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem(ITEM_xys_rings_ring_special_ice), false));
							}
							else if(weapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_POISON)) {
								game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem(ITEM_xys_rings_ring_special_poison), false));
							}
							else {
								game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem(ITEM_xys_rings_ring_special_physical), false));
							};
							flags.setSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_legendary', flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_legendary') + 1);
							pc.removeWeapon(weapon);
							break;
						};
					};
				
					if(temp == flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_legendary')) {
						for (var i = 0; i < mainArray.length; i++) {
							var weapon = mainArray[i];
							if(weapon != null && weapon.getWeaponType().equals(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_legendary)) {
								if(weapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_FIRE)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem(ITEM_xys_rings_ring_special_fire), false));
								}
								else if(weapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_ICE)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem(ITEM_xys_rings_ring_special_ice), false));
								}
								else if(weapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_POISON)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem(ITEM_xys_rings_ring_special_poison), false));
								}
								else {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem(ITEM_xys_rings_ring_special_physical), false));
								};
								flags.setSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_legendary', flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_legendary') + 1);
								pc.unequipMainWeaponIntoVoid(i, false);
								break;
							};
						};
					};

					if(temp == flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_legendary')) {
						for (var i = 0; i < offArray.length; i++) {
							if(offArray[i] != null && offArray[i].getWeaponType().equals(WEAPON_innoxia_crystal_legendary)) {
								if(weapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_FIRE)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem(ITEM_xys_rings_ring_special_fire), false));
								}
								else if(weapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_ICE)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem(ITEM_xys_rings_ring_special_ice), false));
								}
								else if(weapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_POISON)) {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem(ITEM_xys_rings_ring_special_poison), false));
								}
								else {
									game.appendToTextEndStringBuilder(pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem(ITEM_xys_rings_ring_special_physical), false));
								};
								flags.setSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_legendary', flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal_legendary') + 1);
								pc.unequipOffhandWeaponIntoVoid(i, false);
								break;
							};
						};
					};
				]
			#ENDIF
			[##flags.setSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal', flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal') + 1)]

			<p>
				You wisely remain silent as you pocket the gemstone ring away. Some questions are better left unanswered... 
			</p>

			#IF(flags.getSavedLong('xys_ringmaker_crystal') == 9) 
				[##flags.setFlag('xys_ringmaker_quest_complete', true)]
				[##pc.removeItemByType(ITEM_xys_rings_todo_list, 1, true)]
			#ENDIF
		#ELSE
			<p>
				You give the crystal to her, but she shakes her head. [ringmaker.speech(Sorry dear, but I already have enough of that crystal. Please give me something new...?)]
			</p>
			<p>
				You can only pocket it back. Looks like you'll have to swap out with a new one...
			</p>
		#ENDIF

	[##
		pc.unequipMove('xys_magical_girl'); pc.unequipMove('xys_magical_girl_offhand'); pc.unequipMove('xys_change');
		for (var i = 0; i < pc.getArmRows(); i++) {
			if(pc.getMainWeapon(i) != null && pc.getMainWeapon(i).getWeaponType().equals(WEAPON_xys_rings_ring_special)) {
				pc.unequipMainWeapon(i, false, false);
			};
			if(pc.getOffhandWeapon(i) != null && pc.getOffhandWeapon(i).getWeaponType().equals(WEAPON_xys_rings_ring_special)) {
				pc.unequipOffhandWeapon(i, false, false);
			};
		};
		var val = pc.getWeaponCount(itemGen.generateWeapon(WEAPON_xys_rings_ring_special, DAMAGE_TYPE_PHYSICAL))
				+ pc.getWeaponCount(itemGen.generateWeapon(WEAPON_xys_rings_ring_special, DAMAGE_TYPE_FIRE))
				+ pc.getWeaponCount(itemGen.generateWeapon(WEAPON_xys_rings_ring_special, DAMAGE_TYPE_ICE))
				+ pc.getWeaponCount(itemGen.generateWeapon(WEAPON_xys_rings_ring_special, DAMAGE_TYPE_POISON))
				+ pc.getWeaponCount(itemGen.generateWeapon(WEAPON_xys_rings_ring_special, DAMAGE_TYPE_LUST));
	]
	<p>
		The world suddenly seems to shift out of focus, the surroundings becoming washed out and greyscaled. You try to move, but find yourself unable to. Even your eyelids refuse to move. 
	</p>
	<p>
		From the corners of your eyes, you find [#(ringmaker.isPlayerKnowsName()?'Ysette':'a certain ringmaker')] walking towards you, her steps loud and echoing in this silent realm. 
		Stopping right in front of you, she gazes you with glowing ominous eyes. She reaches out her hands... and the 'Special' [#((val>1)?'rings':'ring')] in your inventory [#((val>1)?'are':'is')] taken away from you. 
	</p>
	<p>
		<b>[ringmaker.speech(Sorry about all this fuss, but I've made changes to the rings,)]</b> [ringmaker.name] bleps cheekily. 
		She closes her hands, light pouring from the gaps between her fingers, before reopening them. There's no visual changes... but you can feel that it's <i>different</i>. 
	</p>
	[##var inv = pc.getInventory().getAllWeaponsInInventory().keySet().toArray(); var nums = pc.getInventory().getAllWeaponsInInventory().values().toArray();
		for (var i = 0; i < inv.length; i++) {
			var ringWeapon = inv[i];
			var num = nums[i];
			if(ringWeapon.getWeaponType().equals(WEAPON_xys_rings_ring_special)) {
				if(ringWeapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_PHYSICAL)) {
					pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem('xys_rings_ring_special_physical'), num, false, true);
				}
				else if(ringWeapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_FIRE)) {
					pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem('xys_rings_ring_special_fire'), num, false, true);
				}
				else if(ringWeapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_ICE)) {
					pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem('xys_rings_ring_special_ice'), num, false, true);
				}
				else if(ringWeapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_POISON)) {
					pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem('xys_rings_ring_special_poison'), num, false, true);
				}
				else if(ringWeapon.getDamageType().equals(DAMAGE_TYPE_LUST)) {
					pc.addItem(itemGen.generateItem('xys_rings_ring_special_lust'), num, false, true);
				};
				pc.removeWeapon(ringWeapon, num);
			};
		};
	]
	<p>
		The [#((val>1)?'rings vanish':'ring vanishes')] in an instant, and you instinctively know that it's deposited back into your inventory. 
		<b>[ringmaker.speech(Oh right, had to do changes to the remaining ones...)]</b> she mutters, before she claps her hands. 
	</p>
	<p>
		<b>[ringmaker.speech(Aight, that is all~ Happy playing~)]</b> the eccentric ringmaker waves, before disappearing. In an instant, the world unpauses. You stumble a bit from the sudden continuity, before shaking your head to reorient yourself. 
	</p>
